{
  "about": "External libraries FFmpeg is configured with (packaging/ffmpeg_manifest_linux.json, configuration). tools/gen-notices.sh turns this into the FFmpeg section of THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and fails when the configure line and this file disagree; packaging/check-ffmpeg-depends.py fails when a library BtbN's scripts pull in for those options is neither here nor in not_linked. pinned_repo/pinned_commit are what BtbN's build scripts (corresponding_source.build_scripts) use for the library; the text in licenses/ffmpeg/ was taken from that commit. \"gpl\": true marks a library with no non-GPL licence option that is compiled into a shipped library (signature is a string only it contains, in_libraries the shipped libraries that hold it; verify-appdir.sh checks both).",
  "ignored_options": {
    "--enable-version3": "Selects LGPL version 3 or later (needed by gmp, aribb24, opencore-amr and libvmaf); adds no code.",
